capability_rules:
  mode: DECLARED
  rule_set_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules
  rule_count: 21
  rules:
    R-REQUIRED-DATA-COMPLETENESS:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-REQUIRED-DATA-COMPLETENESS
      rule_id: R-REQUIRED-DATA-COMPLETENESS
      statement: 请求需通过固定 Owner Schema：身份二元键、非空档案、非空变更、合法时间、方案精确可解析；不得从扩展字段补造语义。
      source_section: 四/十
    R-DUPLICATE-REGISTRATION:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-DUPLICATE-REGISTRATION
      rule_id: R-DUPLICATE-REGISTRATION
      statement: 注册以 (identity_namespace, identity_value) 原始字节组合作精确唯一键；同键存在即 MEMBER_DUPLICATE_REGISTRATION；跨线程并发由单一原子唯一性写入保证。
      source_section: 四.1
    R-IDENTITY-STABLE:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-IDENTITY-STABLE
      rule_id: R-IDENTITY-STABLE
      statement: 会员身份必须稳定且可精确解析；稳定会员标识不得因资料修改而变化（业务语义 V0100 第五节确认）。
      source_section: 四.3/五
    R-THREE-STATE-SEPARATION:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-THREE-STATE-SEPARATION
      rule_id: R-THREE-STATE-SEPARATION
      statement: 会员档案状态、会员关系状态、资格判断结果三类状态不得混用（业务语义 V0100 第五节确认）。
      source_section: 五
    R-EXISTENCE-NOT-ELIGIBILITY:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-EXISTENCE-NOT-ELIGIBILITY
      rule_id: R-EXISTENCE-NOT-ELIGIBILITY
      statement: 会员存在、会员关系时间有效和会员权益履约为三个独立事实；本能力只判定 membership_validity，不判定具体权益或订单支付。
      source_section: 五
    R-ELIGIBILITY-BASIS:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-ELIGIBILITY-BASIS
      rule_id: R-ELIGIBILITY-BASIS
      statement: 仅支持 membership_validity；先验证必需历史事实与合法 decision_time，不能把不可判定映射为 false。eligible=true 当且仅当该时点会员 active 且恰好一条有效关系；已终止时
        false/MEMBER_TERMINATED；active 且无关系时 false/NO_EFFECTIVE_MEMBERSHIP。多条件拒绝原因按说明书第 08 Operation 的【补充候选】顺序。
      source_section: 二.08（103-113）
    R-ELIGIBILITY-DECISION:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-ELIGIBILITY-DECISION
      rule_id: R-ELIGIBILITY-DECISION
      statement: eligible=false 是正常判定结果，不触发 StableError；任何调用方不得把 false 解释为 true；业务不支持用此判定替代具体权益核销。
      source_section: 九.场景D/十
    R-CONSISTENT-RESULT:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-CONSISTENT-RESULT
      rule_id: R-CONSISTENT-RESULT
      statement: 相同会员、用途、历史时点和权威业务事实得出一致结果；失败写操作保持原状；跨操作的历史事实不得由即时快照覆盖。
      source_section: 一.4/一.5，二.01-09
    R-PLAN-EXISTENCE:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-PLAN-EXISTENCE
      rule_id: R-PLAN-EXISTENCE
      statement: 建立及替换关系时必须精确调用已声明 Membership Plan Provider 的 resolve_membership_plan，只接受 state=active 的真实方案；不得凭名称、空引用或调用成功标识推断方案可用。
      source_section: 一.5，二.05/06
    R-STATE-TRANSITION-GUARD:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-STATE-TRANSITION-GUARD
      rule_id: R-STATE-TRANSITION-GUARD
      statement: member 仅 active->terminated；membership 仅 active->replaced（变更方案的旧关系）。终止或替换都是终态；没有隐式恢复与重叠转移。
      source_section: 四.4/六
    R-AUTH-DEFAULT-DENY:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-AUTH-DEFAULT-DENY
      rule_id: R-AUTH-DEFAULT-DENY
      statement: 所有 9 个 Operation 必须有真实业务授权；未声明、不可验证或无法映射到可信 Actor 的调用一律拒绝（OPERATION_NOT_AUTHORIZED）。不得把权限未定义推断为 UNRESTRICTED。
      source_section: 一.5（49）及二.01-09；附记（124-129）
      x_authorization_actor_source_status: NOT_SUPPLIED_NO_ALLOW_LIST_AUTHORIZED
    R-EFFECTIVE-TIME-MEMBER-STATUS:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-EFFECTIVE-TIME-MEMBER-STATUS
      rule_id: R-EFFECTIVE-TIME-MEMBER-STATUS
      statement: create_membership 只在拟生效时点 member_status=active 时可建立方案关系，历史时点必须读取会员状态历史；不得拿当前状态替代。
      source_section: 会员说明书 82-87
      x_source_status: DECLARED_V0103_CANDIDATE_BUSINESS_LOGIC
    R-TEMPORAL-BOUNDS:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-TEMPORAL-BOUNDS
      rule_id: R-TEMPORAL-BOUNDS
      statement: 建立关系及更换方案时，未填时点使用提交时点；显式时点 <= 提交时点；建立关系不能早于会员创建，更换不能早于旧关系开始。
      source_section: 会员说明书 42-50,82-94
      x_source_status: DECLARED_V0103_CANDIDATE_BUSINESS_LOGIC
    R-ONE-EFFECTIVE-RELATION:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-ONE-EFFECTIVE-RELATION
      rule_id: R-ONE-EFFECTIVE-RELATION
      statement: 任一会员在同一时点最多一条生效方案关系；创建/更换不得造成有效区间重叠，并发操作必须原子保护此不变量。
      source_section: 会员说明书 42-50,82-94
      x_source_status: DECLARED_V0103_CANDIDATE_BUSINESS_LOGIC
    R-ATOMIC-RELATION-REPLACEMENT:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-ATOMIC-RELATION-REPLACEMENT
      rule_id: R-ATOMIC-RELATION-REPLACEMENT
      statement: 更换方案只在旧关系属于该会员且 active、目标方案不同且可用时，原子结束旧关系并创建新关系；历史不覆盖，响应必须有新旧关系标识。
      source_section: 会员说明书 89-94
      x_source_status: DECLARED_V0103_CANDIDATE_BUSINESS_LOGIC
    R-HISTORICAL-INTERVAL-LOOKUP:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-HISTORICAL-INTERVAL-LOOKUP
      rule_id: R-HISTORICAL-INTERVAL-LOOKUP
      statement: 关系查询按 effective_time <= as_of_time < termination_time 选择至多一条关系；当无结束时点表示未结束；资料缺失或历史冲突不能返回伪造成功。
      source_section: 会员说明书 96-113
      x_source_status: DECLARED_V0103_CANDIDATE_BUSINESS_LOGIC
    R-ELIGIBILITY-REASON-PRIORITY:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-ELIGIBILITY-REASON-PRIORITY
      rule_id: R-ELIGIBILITY-REASON-PRIORITY
      statement: 资格原因严格按本版说明书第 08 Operation 的【补充候选】先判断会员在判定时点是否 terminated，再在 active 情形判断关系有效性；数据未知不能返回 false。
      source_section: 会员说明书 103-113
      x_source_status: DECLARED_V0103_CANDIDATE_BUSINESS_LOGIC
    R-OWNER-PROFILE-DISCLOSURE:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-OWNER-PROFILE-DISCLOSURE
      rule_id: R-OWNER-PROFILE-DISCLOSURE
      statement: 会员档案读取只返回获准披露的资料；本版公开查询默认仅提供展示资料，不因保存 contact_email 就公开联系方式。
      source_section: 会员说明书 61-66
      x_source_status: DECLARED_V0103_CANDIDATE_BUSINESS_LOGIC
    R-RETRY-NO-DUPLICATE-RELATION:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-RETRY-NO-DUPLICATE-RELATION
      rule_id: R-RETRY-NO-DUPLICATE-RELATION
      statement: 重复创建及重复更换必须按已有业务状态重新判断；重复关系更换不得从已 replaced 的旧关系成功创建第二个后继关系。
      source_section: 会员说明书 42-50,54-59,82-94
      x_source_status: DECLARED_V0103_CANDIDATE_BUSINESS_LOGIC
    R-EXACT-INTERNAL-MEMBERSHIP-READ:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-EXACT-INTERNAL-MEMBERSHIP-READ
      rule_id: R-EXACT-INTERNAL-MEMBERSHIP-READ
      statement: 内部 resolve_membership 严格使用提供的 membership_ref 查一条历史记录，绝不自动选最新、不以其它关系代替。
      source_section: 会员说明书 115-120
      x_source_status: DECLARED_V0103_CANDIDATE_BUSINESS_LOGIC
    R-NO-PAYMENT-OR-ENTITLEMENT-INFERENCE:
      rule_ref: Q.MEMBERSHIP.CONTRACT.CAPABILITY.MEMBER@V0104#/capability_rules/rules/R-NO-PAYMENT-OR-ENTITLEMENT-INFERENCE
      rule_id: R-NO-PAYMENT-OR-ENTITLEMENT-INFERENCE
      statement: 本版建立关系候选业务逻辑不要求支付凭据；任何写操作不产生支付、订单或具体权益履约事实。
      source_section: 会员说明书 20-22,42-50,82-94
      x_source_status: DECLARED_V0103_CANDIDATE_BUSINESS_LOGIC
  x_unapproved_business_policy_summary: 身份去重、方案选择、关系并存、生命周期、资格及原因优先级、免支付前置是已写明候选逻辑，不等于获得 Owner 批准。
